This application needs Java 17 or later and IBM's MQ client, which is not included in this zip.
Download com.ibm.mq.jakarta.client.jar from Maven Central and save it in the "lib" directory as "com.ibm.mq.jakarta.client.jar":
https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/com/ibm/mq/com.ibm.mq.jakarta.client/10.0.0.5/com.ibm.mq.jakarta.client-10.0.0.5.jar
It is the same jar Traffic Parrot uses: https://trafficparrot.com/documentation/latest/jms.html#ibm-mq-libs
Then run start.sh (start.cmd on Windows) and open http://localhost:8383 to place orders.
